# deployment.mdc

```yaml
deployment:
  cloudProvider: TBD

  environments:
    - name: local
      purpose: deterministic contract, executor, subgraph mapping, and UI development
      runCommand: npm test in contracts; Docker Compose for PostgreSQL/executor; npm run dev in each UI
    - name: base-sepolia
      purpose: sole shared integration and capped MVP test environment for this phase
      deployMechanism: Hardhat Diamond deployment, Goldsky subgraph deployment, one executor container, and static Vite clients

  strategy:
    type: staged Base Sepolia rollout with feature flags default-off for risky automation
    featureFlags: executor pricing and matching writes support dry-run/shadow mode before enablement

  rollback:
    code: revert the coordinated PRs and redeploy previous UI/executor artifacts; use an additive Diamond cut to restore prior facet selectors
    database: apply only reversible migrations and run documented down migrations after disabling executor writes
    config: restore the prior versioned deployment manifest and keep the platform paused until ABI, subgraph, and clients agree

  ci:
    provider: Jenkins for current UIs; GitHub checks and executor pipeline to be added
    prChecks: required-before-merge across every coordinated repository
    watchCommand: gh pr checks {number}

  observability:
    apm: TBD
    logs: structured redacted executor logs with request, job, order, price-round, decision, and transaction correlation IDs
    metrics:
      - chain head and finalized cursor lag
      - subgraph indexing lag and errors
      - price age, source count, and deviation
      - match latency, candidate count, and rejection reason
      - queue depth, retry count, uncertain transactions, and nonce state
      - session failures and privileged API denials

  secrets:
    injection: server-only environment or managed secret store; never Docker build args or VITE variables
    signing: replaced testnet deployer required before transactions; production-style updater and assigner use separate managed identities

  baseSepolia:
    chainId: 84532
    usdc: 0x036CbD53842c5426634e7929541eC2318f3dCF7e
    rpc: server-side Alchemy endpoint from injected environment
    subgraph: Goldsky endpoint generated after final Diamond deployment
    deploymentManifest: one generated versioned JSON artifact consumed by contracts, executor, subgraph, and all UIs
```
